 "_comment": "Synopsis field -> monday column map. Read by lib/synopsis/* only.\ncolumnId      = the column on the DEAL board the value is READ from (a mirror, for client/project fields).\nownerColumnId = the column on the OWNING board a write must TARGET. Writing to a mirror does nothing.\nAll column ids/titles/types were read from the live boards on 18/08/2026.\n'required' is a judgement from reading two real synopses and is NOT confirmed by the firm — review it.\nNOTE vs config/monday-boards.json: that file maps WORKFLOW columns (status, paralegal, milestone dates) for the daily/alert agents. This one maps DEAL CONTENT for the letter. They overlap on exactly two columns — date81__1 (registrationDeadline / signing_deadline) and date58__1 (contractSignActualDate / signing_date). Kept separate on purpose: different consumers, different lifecycles."
